{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144655,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"Table VI. Test Sets, Dependence Structure, and Coverage\nNote. Videos are the frozen test manifests; coverage and preprocessing failures were identical for every model, seed, and direction. Clusters are the resampling units. Celeb-DF v2 was split by target identity; all 843 fake videos lie in 9 identity clusters, so its intervals are approximate, and whether the swapped-in source identity was also held out could not be verified. Lineage counts follow the evaluation protocol. Strict subsets exclude target videos whose lineage appears in the source’s training or validation data. Source-validation coverage: 279/280 (FF++ C23 and C40), 977/977 (Celeb-DF v2), 192/192 (DeeperForensics-1.0)."}},
